 "task7": {
  "decisions": [
   {
    "Design choice": "Retrieval method",
    "Selected option": "Hybrid RRF (BM25 + dense) + cross-encoder re-ranking",
    "Justification (from our experiments)": "Table 3.4: NQ Recall@10 BM25 0.90 / dense 0.97 / hybrid 0.93; curated multi-source Recall@10 0.90 / 1.00 / 0.93. Dense alone has the best Recall@10 (dense), but only the top-5 reaches the prompt: NQ Recall@5 is highest for hybrid + cross-encoder (0.94 vs dense 0.90), and BM25 keeps exact names/numbers retrievable. On the small curated set dense is ahead (Recall@5 0.87 vs 0.82), so the two are close; we keep hybrid + CE for robustness and accept ~0.7s re-ranking latency."
   },
   {
